Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.37,0:00:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End of the Sea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know there's an awesome\Ntreasure hidden at the end of the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.23,0:00:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And anyone who finds it,\Nthe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.95,0:00:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that exciting or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.47,0:00:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are incredible adventures\Nout there just waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have the courage that sail and believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we will see a glimpse of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.23,0:00:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sun rising on our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Feeso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.27,0:00:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we first started,\Nwe had separate horizons,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.85,0:00:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sailed toward different dreams.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Datenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.73,0:00:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have changed now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.81,0:00:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for together we found we looked\Nthrough the spyglass and see.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Galaxy 9000\NPepperjack\NPhosCity\NScolines\NZenef
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.23,0:01:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we know that our hearts\Nhave brought us here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.19,0:01:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where the conscious point's our destiny.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no looking back,\Ntake the hell with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.03,0:01:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, we can't\Nstop all our troubles!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.27,0:01:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the future's\Nunclear, we still can smile.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Timing/Typesetting
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Gab
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.17,0:01:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know we'll get there, no regrets!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(24,113)}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(67.02,153.65)}Camotoy\NGordingus\NPollychan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.53,0:01:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every tear that we've cried only helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.39,0:01:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our dreams come true!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(964,111.4)}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(1007.02,152.05)}arch1t3cht\NFunimation\NLiisa-Pekka
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.89,0:01:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and those dreams\Nare precious in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.55,0:01:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun\Nrising on our tomorrow?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.07,0:01:53.95,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(561,0)\bord2.3\c&HE8E6E7&\3c&H363635&\1a&HFF&\t(519,561,\1a&H00&)}Pirate Zoro vs. Priest Ohm
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.07,0:01:53.95,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(561,0)\c&HE8E6E7&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Pirate Zoro vs. Priest Ohm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.11,0:01:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite the gathering!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.63,0:02:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many players remain\Nin our little game?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have four Divine Squad members,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.27,0:02:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and since I dealt the wounds\NI dealt those two were fatal,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.43,0:02:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that leaves us with four Shandians\Nand one Blue Sea dweller?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.59,0:02:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,counting the Lord of the Sky and Holy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.67,0:02:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's ten people and two animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.99,0:02:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will pay for harming Wiper!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.01,0:02:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.49,0:02:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd willingly forfeit\Nyour life for this speck,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.23,0:02:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mind who you throw your\Nloyalty to, Savage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.73,0:02:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.17,0:02:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy, it's time for your mad dash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.13,0:02:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't stop! Finish it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.87,0:03:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's building some kind of fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.95,0:03:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, he's using more of his tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.27,0:03:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This could be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No tricks here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.65,0:03:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the ordeal of iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.31,0:03:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The white barbed deathmatch has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.69,0:03:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you can put up a fence? Big\Ndeal. I wasn't planning to run the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.27,0:03:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,purpose of this barrier isn't just\Nto hold you yes there's a reason
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.53,0:03:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's called white barbs what's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.35,0:03:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that i
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.41,0:03:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guess the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.49,0:04:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thorns are painful
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thanks for So how do I get out of\Nhere once I'm done with all of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can worry about that\Nlater, assuming you survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.61,0:04:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only eight people and two animals left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.25,0:04:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.17,0:04:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.93,0:04:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper! Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.37,0:04:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.28,0:04:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't much time! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.61,0:04:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.49,0:04:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to come to give\Nyou Kamakiri's warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.35,0:04:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody can beat Enel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.17,0:04:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.99,0:04:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Abandon this fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:04:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.25,0:05:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enel is lightning itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.35,0:05:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He truly has the powers of a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.87,0:05:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cannot be defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.05,0:05:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.49,0:05:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.69,0:05:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I hear my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.41,0:05:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enel
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.41,0:05:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enel, leave her be!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.69,0:05:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lockie's not here to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lock, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.09,0:05:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd forget about her and\Nworry more about myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.37,0:05:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lock, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.31,0:05:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.45,0:06:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't be conquered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.11,0:06:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've sealed your fate, Wiper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You damn fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.93,0:06:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.71,0:06:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anna Ru.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.87,0:06:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be writhing in pure agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's try that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.15,0:07:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't actually\Nthink I'd spare her wiper
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.37,0:07:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the ruthless Shandora warrior surely you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.29,0:07:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand the concept\Nof no mercy she opposed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.21,0:07:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me and now she's dead\Nyou'll join her soon enough
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.99,0:07:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.75,0:07:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's God?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.07,0:07:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weep not for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.79,0:07:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.35,0:07:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we're all getting personal,\Nthere's a score I have to settle as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.25,0:07:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.43,0:07:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to cough up what's in your belly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.73,0:07:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.99,0:07:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:07:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They need a hug!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.11,0:08:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iceberg and whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.99,0:08:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The numbers dwindle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.99,0:08:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six people and two animals remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where in the world is this place\Nwe got swallowed up? Remember? Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.66,0:08:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.54,0:08:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beast seems even\Nlarger from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.16,0:08:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isa, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper, please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.20,0:09:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, for the umpteenth time,\Nwe've been eaten by a snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.40,0:09:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A snake?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, we'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can escape before it digests us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.50,0:09:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you two doing out there you should\Nbe on the ship tell that to the Creeps
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.74,0:09:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who were chasing us we had to run for our\Nlives isn't that little girl a Shandora
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.68,0:09:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down, anyway,\Nwhy don't we simply
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,carve our way out are you\Ninsane old man Suppose
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the snake starts going wild you're gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.98,0:09:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get us all killed you\Nknow For a night you're
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty dense by y'all was kidding we're in
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stomach? A snake's\Nstomach? I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much you know about\Nanatomy but it won't be
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.90,0:09:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,long before we're bathing\Nin its metabolic acid
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.58,0:10:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.26,0:10:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy I was starting to think\NI was the only one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the strangest cave
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you end up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.94,0:10:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.94,0:10:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got stuck here and I can't get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This snakes turning out\Nto be a serious problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.90,0:10:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A snake who'd you think\Nthis stomach belong to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how could you be here talking to me if
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were swallowed by\Na giant snake like I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.96,0:10:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said, big blue reptile\Nwith my long fangs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It ate it and now we're\Nstuck in his belly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.56,0:10:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on Nami, that hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.74,0:10:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he a jester?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That job would suit him best,\Nbut he's actually captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.72,0:11:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's your captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My word.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this world coming to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure are calm for someone\Nwho's been eaten by a monster
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's stomach acid is melting your clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're right
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we waiting for we need to\Nfind its butthole right away ridiculous
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.44,0:11:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why maybe we can get out next time\Nthe snake goes to the bathroom
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.56,0:11:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.47,0:11:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather get digested!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.46,0:11:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.48,0:11:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what you mean, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.70,0:11:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's meaner than the snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.26,0:11:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hardly, when the snake gets in a\Nbad mood, it starts eating people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And speaking of which,\Nwe'd better think fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.06,0:11:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its temper was wild enough on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, the snake was in a bad mood?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, what have you been doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.92,0:12:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was trying to bust through\Na wall didn't work though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.70,0:12:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so this is all you're doing throwing all\Nthose punches burned up a lot of energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.44,0:12:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sam did any of you think\Nto bring some food?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you eat my
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.26,0:13:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Got a bellyache?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.10,0:13:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It serves you right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.64,0:13:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be long, Isa! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.24,0:13:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open up, Serpent!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.06,0:13:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is getting really old.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.68,0:13:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That extendable sword is using as a\Npain and that snake I already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.78,0:13:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defeating him first isn't exactly\Ngoing to be a walk in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.48,0:13:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have to get Nami and the old\Nknight out of that thing's gut right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.96,0:13:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.34,0:13:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since they were swallowed hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.56,0:14:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and bet they're not dead yet, but\Nit won't be that way for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,IZENWHIP!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.14,0:14:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.62,0:14:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,IZENWHIP!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.02,0:14:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.94,0:14:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come he always knows\Nexactly where I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.18,0:14:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as if he could see\Nme from behind that wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this madman?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.78,0:14:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with those glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now prepare to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another voice has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are only a few survivors\Nin the upper ruins now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.94,0:14:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just five people and two animals remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.38,0:15:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make that four people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.20,0:15:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Park wave guys in back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.24,0:15:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An iron wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sword is an iron cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.80,0:15:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't think clouds had\Na set shape, did you? You?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.22,0:15:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aizen fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.50,0:15:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aizen fork!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.24,0:15:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aizen rapier pack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's predicting my movements.\NWhy can't I avoid it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.68,0:15:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.30,0:16:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keeping your distance doesn't do you\Nany good when you depend on your sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.56,0:16:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.84,0:16:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,36 Caliber Phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arsene Witt!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.50,0:16:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he block it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.42,0:16:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite an interesting technique\Nyou've developed, Blue Sea Dweller.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.20,0:16:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who wonder if you'll try that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.16,0:16:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, even if you lose sight\Nof me, I'll always know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By using mantra
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.32,0:17:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,looks
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.29,0:17:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we just lost another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.21,0:17:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now there are two animals
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.94,0:17:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and three people left but
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.34,0:17:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soon there will be two\Nanimals and only two people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.68,0:17:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're the leader of the\Nblue sea people up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.10,0:17:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and your comrades,\NI'll put up a good fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, my sword is now\Npointed directly at your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say your prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swordsman don't be an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.94,0:17:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never pray for anything that's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.96,0:17:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should use your resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.64,0:17:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.42,0:18:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can follow that extendable sort of\Nyours and know exactly where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well the moment you find
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.78,0:18:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One life holds 36 worldly desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.54,0:18:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two lives hold 72.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.04,0:18:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three lives hold 108 worldly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.34,0:18:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.25,0:18:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three swords, 108 caliber Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We broke through the iron clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.70,0:18:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.88,0:19:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.60,0:19:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.51,0:19:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.36,0:19:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, just knock\Nyourself unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:13.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta hurry and take care of\Nthat snake and the bazooka guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.06,0:19:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shandora, the City of Gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if the Golden Bell said to be in the\Nmiddle of the city isn't here, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The belfry was probably\Nengraved with poneglyphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.58,0:19:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then the city\Nprobably fell in order to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after all this time, the Belfry\Nand the Poneglyph should still be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.86,0:19:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're hidden, somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.36,0:19:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.86,0:19:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A rail used to run through this city
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:20:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is new something\Nwas moved out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.96,0:20:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what it was
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.88,0:20:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it amazing? Even after\Nbeing shot up into the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.66,0:20:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the city of Shandora still\Nmajestically exists in this way
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.28,0:20:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it's a city that\Neveryone knows about,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.02,0:20:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how can it show off its\Nlovely figure if it's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.00,0:20:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,covered by clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who could see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.36,0:20:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I discovered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.90,0:20:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The former gods never
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.04,0:20:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.95,0:20:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.06,0:20:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.98,0:20:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're quite intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.40,0:20:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One might Guess that\Nyou're an archaeologist
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.56,0:20:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the blue sea world\Nby how fast you found.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.10,0:20:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city of ruins it took\Nus several months to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.20,0:20:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same thing I suppose it's easier if you\NCan read the letters on the ruins right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.88,0:21:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately the gold you're
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.68,0:21:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,looking for isn't Here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.18,0:21:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're a few\Nyears too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.48,0:21:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gold well you're right\Nabout That I couldn't find any.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.36,0:21:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have been the one who removed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.44,0:21:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold is a wonderful thing to Have and\Nthat glittering metal suits me well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.58,0:21:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.49,0:21:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you must also Have taken the\Ngolden bell that was once here. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.58,0:21:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a golden bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.12,0:21:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.28,0:21:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well I'm very intrigued.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.02,0:21:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you learn by reading\Nthose letters on the bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.54,0:21:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.02,0:21:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never got to read them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.36,0:21:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you say it wasn't here when\Nyou arrived, it must not exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.10,0:21:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the huge golden bell\Nand belfry that were the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.96,0:21:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pride of Shandora must have\Nonly been another legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.82,0:21:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame that I'll never\Nbe able to lay my eyes on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.84,0:22:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait. It's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.64,0:22:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's actually right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.52,0:22:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's here in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.38,0:22:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When this island was blown into the sky\N400 years ago when the Upper Yard was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.74,0:22:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or when Godland was born,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.26,0:22:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was said that the loud\Nchimes of a bell could
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.44,0:22:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be heard ringing throughout\Nthe entire nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.88,0:22:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The elder inhabitants of this land\Ncalled it the island's singing voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.34,0:22:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that wasn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.00,0:22:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.42,0:22:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bell made of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.06,0:22:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing soon the entire game will be over
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.68,0:22:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only eight minutes left.\NThat's not long at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.28,0:22:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, it gives me plenty of\Ntime to look for the Golden Bell
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.58,0:22:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the Golden Bell is in the sky,\Nwhich means the poneglyphs are too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.34,0:23:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting it sounds like\Nthere's a maggot on the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.04,0:23:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you,\NSue? Did we forget to see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.16,0:23:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sue, are you in pain,\Nor did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.82,0:23:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.00,0:23:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm one of the men who used to\Nserve God and fell when he was God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.14,0:23:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're one of the divine warriors?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.80,0:23:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were in a closed off area and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.10,0:23:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness, what on earth happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.44,0:23:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conis, he needs your help right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.32,0:23:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.34,0:23:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.36,0:23:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My family's on Angel Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.72,0:23:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, please help. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.88,0:23:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know everyone's\Nworried about all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.64,0:23:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let everyone know, Akainu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.76,0:24:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's planning to return everything. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.02,0:24:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Skypiea will be dropped\Nback into the Blue Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.86,0:24:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and this entire nation\Nwill no longer exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.26,0:24:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that can't be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.10,0:24:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time to lose! You\Nmust tell everyone! Do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.90,0:24:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our lives will soon be\Nover and a room is planning
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.60,0:24:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to eliminate every living\Nperson from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.06,0:24:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eliminate everyone from the sky but\Nwait if he succeeds in that then?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.16,0:24:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't have a place to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.06,0:24:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.54,0:24:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would he want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.68,0:24:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He built a ship, the Ark Maxim.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.80,0:24:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ark Maxim?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.06,0:24:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.26,0:24:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were forced to spend the last six\Nyears of our lives building that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.94,0:25:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.98,0:25:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the sky finally becomes peaceful,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.58,0:25:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to be able to show everyone the
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.98,0:25:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hospitality they once knew\Nto my heart's content,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.34,0:25:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,including you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.32,0:25:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.68,0:25:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly did you just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.98,0:25:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.92,0:25:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I showed mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.00,0:25:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.18,0:25:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he has Logia power.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.10,0:25:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, I must say what little time\Nwe have left here is coming to a close.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.00,0:25:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the beginning of the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.02,0:25:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will now set into motion a series of\Nevents that will reveal my ultimate plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.42,0:26:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What plan? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.48,0:26:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sky Lord is calling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.28,0:26:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heed my call, lonely\Nbeings, and come to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.30,0:26:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.04,0:26:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.46,0:26:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.74,0:26:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was I who brought you and\Nyour friends here to Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.62,0:26:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beckoned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.94,0:26:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.56,0:26:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man possesses such tremendous power.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.58,0:27:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole place has brought me apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.40,0:27:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.31,0:27:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Enel!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.23,0:27:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the only one who's powerful\Nenough to do something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.32,0:27:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd better think of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.68,0:27:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.42,0:27:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.44,0:27:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a hole at the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.42,0:27:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now this brings us\Nto our climactic finale!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.28,0:27:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suggest we attempt\Nour escape now! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.58,0:27:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's now or never!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.30,0:27:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, get over here and\Ngrab hold of the Waver!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.64,0:27:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna finally get\Nus out of this snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.92,0:28:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.83,0:28:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey you, hang on to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.36,0:28:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.40,0:28:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.31,0:28:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.30,0:28:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man overboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.52,0:28:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't leave them!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.54,0:28:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pierre, go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.56,0:28:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to save those two!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.98,0:28:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How will I pick it up so high?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.06,0:28:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.56,0:28:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mia, Mia, don't worry about me,\Nyou'll have to save the others! Mia!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.20,0:28:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are we gonna do now that\Nthe bird's gone, you weird old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.00,0:28:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Gonbe, it's Gonbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.68,0:28:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care, just save us!

